le snapshots, retained configuration and data, and recovered routing behavior.","limitations":["The node-wide system state became degraded because ssh.service was failed, but lifecycle evidence shows that failure predated executor work and remained unchanged. Consequently, recovery is fully demonstrated for the task-relevant logging services and data, but not as an entirely failure-free node-wide state (cmd-dd3b6f1d5b1846c1; global:before_prepare:node1:failed-services; global:after_executor:node1:failed-services)."]}
